        ['q' => 'Is wind and hail damage in San Antonio covered by TWIA?', 'a' => '<p>Generally no. Bexar County is not in the Texas Windstorm Insurance Association\'s designated catastrophe area, so San Antonio properties typically get wind and hail coverage from their regular property insurer, or from the Texas FAIR Plan where applicable. Many Texas policies carry a separate wind/hail deductible, often a percentage of the dwelling limit, so check your declarations page.</p>'],
